ids runs from 1951 to 2025, and May to June and August to September each came in under 90% of normal in 40 of 75 years. In 2025, June to July on the middle of the grids came in at 12% of normal. This year so far, May to June on the middle of the grids came in at 37% of normal in 2026. Grid 25272 had its driest year in 1966 at 54% of normal.</p>"}
